<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="t00534">
	<title>Turning off Manual Speed Limit Assist</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>manual speed limit assist (MSLA) 
					<indexterm>turning off manual speed limit assist</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04036">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" outputclass="FormatC" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="col1" colsep="0">
							<fig id="e04037">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/OOV055005.eps" placement="break" id="e04038"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>To resume Manual Speed Limit Assist after the function was paused, operate the (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_334.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04039"/>), (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_335.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04040"/>) or (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" scale="15" id="e04041"/>) switch.</p>
		<p>If you push the (+) switch up or (–) switch down, vehicle speed will be set to the current speed on the cluster.</p>
		<p>If you press the (<image align="left" height="0.117in" href="../../images/WKIA_079.eps" outputclass="nolabel" placement="inline" width="0.117in" scale="15" id="e04042"/>) switch, vehicle speed will resume to the preset speed.</p>
	</conbody>
</concept>